Breaking down bills

I’m pulling irrigation water from a well and need help tracking usage against my seasonal water allocation. How can I estimate how much I’ve used so far?

Start by calculating average flow rate and total pumping hours per week. Multiply flow rate by hours to estimate weekly usage, then track cumulative totals against your permitted allocation. Reviewing this monthly can help you adjust irrigation before you exceed limits.

