Solving problems without stopping the work

Customers regularly walk in with niche or technical requests, demanding knowledge beyond what one person can reasonably hold. This is where Richard uses ChatGPT to look up specifications, materials, or calculations on the spot, turning what used to be long follow-ups into immediate answers—and keeps the work moving.

For Richard, the value isn’t speed for its own sake. In a business built on momentum and safety, faster answers mean smoother days, especially when, on most days, “downtime is not an option.” Fewer bottlenecks mean fewer stalled days, safer workflows, and more time spent guiding the people who keep the yard running. ChatGPT doesn’t just change how he works; it helps him keep things moving in a place where standing still isn’t an option.

